865
00:51:21,250 --> 00:51:22,541
Molly.

866
00:51:23,583 --> 00:51:24,791
Molly.

867
00:51:26,208 --> 00:51:27,458
Molly.

868
00:51:27,458 --> 00:51:29,750
Pero ahora sé que voy a dejarla.

869
00:51:29,750 --> 00:51:31,083
No quiero.

870
00:51:31,083 --> 00:51:33,375
-Molly.
